/-!
# Residuals and solvable overgroups in §13.8

Source: Aschbacher–Smith, combined manuscript (1 March 2004), Lemmas
13.8.12–14, printed pp.950–951. The imported definitions use the actual
Fitting preimage O₂,F(H) and distinguish both two-residuals and L₁ from L₁,+.
The proved deductions select a minimal member of the genuine Hz family,
establish the fixed-space and disjoint-summand steps, and prove solvability
of the Fitting envelope. They supply parts of the source proof, not the full
numbered lemmas. The component and residual argument, supercritical reduction,
and small-prime action constructions remain assembly obligations.
-/
